    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Inkeeper is an open-world action-adventure game where players complete platforming puzzles, interact with townsfolk, and explore ruined structures in order to uncover secrets about a calamity that befell the world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Inkeeper is an open-world action-adventure game where players complete platforming puzzles, interact with townsfolk, and explore ruined structures in order to uncover secrets about a calamity that befell the world.</p>",
